  "verify": "Pins from Waveshare's demo code and schematic (https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-C6-GEEK (commit e9ea5866ff87bef10fd2bcac07dc57a1004264d0; example/ESP32-C6-GEEK-Demo = V1, example/ESP32-C6-GEEK_V2-Demo = V2)). Two hardware revisions: V2 (shipping from 2026-03-23, 'V2' on the back) puts the TF card on the LCD's SPI bus (SCK 1, MOSI 2, MISO 20, CS 23); V1 had the TF card on its own pins (SCK 19, MOSI 18, MISO 20, CS 23).",
